{"seq":2,"slug":"packaging-material-library-selection","title":"箱/缓冲/填充包材库与选型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/packaging-loading-optimization/dimension-packaging-masterdata/packaging-material-library-selection","wordCount":2099,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"箱-缓冲-填充包材库与选型\">箱/缓冲/填充包材库与选型</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>包材库是装箱算法的<strong>搜索空间</strong>。目录里有多少种箱型、每种箱的内径与承重标定得准不准，直接决定了算法能不能找到省钱解。现实中大量团队的&quot;包材库&quot;其实是一张 Excel：型号、外径、图片、报价，没有内径，没有承重，没有纸板等级——这种库无法参与计算，只能靠人工挑。</p>\n<p>把包材库变成可计算的数据，关键是把每个包材拆成三类属性：<strong>几何</strong>（内径长宽高、壁厚）、<strong>力学</strong>（承压能力、适用重量段）、<strong>经济</strong>（单价、最小起订量、是否可回收）。三者缺一，算法要么算不准要么算不对。三者的缺失会分别导致不同的失败模式，值得分开记住：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>属性类</th>\n<th>必须字段</th>\n<th>缺失时的失败模式</th>\n<th>补齐难度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>几何</td>\n<td>内径长宽高、壁厚</td>\n<td>装得下却报装不下，或选到过大的箱</td>\n<td>低（量一次即可）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>力学</td>\n<td>边压强度、标称承重</td>\n<td>选出承压不足的箱，堆码时压溃</td>\n<td>中（需厂商数据或测试）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>经济</td>\n<td>单价、币种、起订量</td>\n<td>成本目标函数失真，优化方向错误</td>\n<td>低（采购系统已有）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[包材目录] --&gt; B[外箱 corrugated box]&#10;  A --&gt; C[缓冲 cushioning]&#10;  A --&gt; D[填充 void fill]&#10;  A --&gt; E[封合 closure]&#10;  B --&gt; F[选箱搜索空间]&#10;  C --&gt; G[易碎件加固]&#10;  D --&gt; G&#10;  E --&gt; H[操作工时]&#10;  F --&gt; I[Cartonization]&#10;  G --&gt; I\">graph TD\n  A[包材目录] --&gt; B[外箱 corrugated box]\n  A --&gt; C[缓冲 cushioning]\n  A --&gt; D[填充 void fill]\n  A --&gt; E[封合 closure]\n  B --&gt; F[选箱搜索空间]\n  C --&gt; G[易碎件加固]\n  D --&gt; G\n  E --&gt; H[操作工时]\n  F --&gt; I[Cartonization]\n  G --&gt; I</pre><h2 id=\"箱型与几何标定\">箱型与几何标定</h2><h3 id=\"内径才是可用空间\">内径才是可用空间</h3><p>包材库里最常被记错的是&quot;外径当内径用&quot;。瓦楞纸箱的外径 = 内径 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+ 2 \\times</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span> 壁厚，单瓦（单坑）壁厚常见 3mm 上下，双瓦（双坑）可达 6–7mm 以上。用外径去装一个刚好卡边的商品，会稳定地差出一堵纸板厚度从而装不下。因此目录必须<strong>只存内径</strong>，外径由壁厚派生；任何以毫米计的业务口径都以内径为准。</p>\n<p>标记方式上，纸箱厂商普遍使用 FEFCO 与 ASSCO 的箱型编码体系来描述结构（如 0201 是最常见的开槽箱 RSC，0427 是全日盖箱等）。在数据模型里存一个 <code>fefcoCode</code> 字段很有价值：它让&quot;结构强度&quot;和&quot;是否需要特殊成型工时&quot;变成可查询的属性，而不是藏在图片里。</p>\n<h3 id=\"壁厚与内径的换算\">壁厚与内径的换算</h3><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{outer} = d_{inner} + 2t \\qquad V_{usable} = l_i \\times w_i \\times h_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">inn</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ab</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0197em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 为单侧壁厚。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{usable}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ab</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是算法用于体积利用率的<strong>净可用容积</strong>，不含纸板本身。注意这个式子假设箱壁在装载时不被撑出——对重货成立，对超载轻泡货会被鼓包撑开，这是第 4 章讨论破损时要处理的情形。</p>\n<h2 id=\"缓冲与填充\">缓冲与填充</h2><h3 id=\"缓冲材料的选型逻辑\">缓冲材料的选型逻辑</h3><p>缓冲（cushioning）的作用是把冲击能量拉长到更长时间释放，核心参数是<strong>动态缓冲曲线</strong>：给定静应力与跌落高度，得到传递到产品的减速度。工程上极少真的去算曲线，而是按产品脆值与重量查厂商给的选型表，再留安全系数。</p>\n<p>这里有一个必须知道的测评框架：包装件能不能上市，通常靠 ISTA 或 ASTM D4169 这类运输包装测试来证明，而不是靠算。ISTA 把测试分成若干系列——1 系是非模拟完整性测试（筛选用途），3 系是通用模拟测试（模拟真实运输中的冲击、振动、压缩并预测损伤风险），6 系则是特定零售/承运方定制的成员性能测试；其中 <strong>ISTA 6-Amazon.com-SIOC</strong> 针对&quot;以自身包装直发、不经亚马逊二次包装&quot;的商品，声明它覆盖经由包裹或零担出库、从入仓到末端配送的全链路危害（见 <a href=\"https://ista.org/test_procedures.php\">ISTA Test Procedures</a>）。这给了一个可直接落地的判据：<strong>凡是要做 SIOC 直发的箱型，其缓冲配置必须按对应测试方案验证过</strong>，验证结论写进包材目录的一个 <code>certifiedFor</code> 字段。</p>\n<h3 id=\"填充与二次利用\">填充与二次利用</h3><p>填充（void fill，如充气袋、纸填充、气泡膜）解决的是&quot;箱选大了&quot;的剩余空间。它在成本上处于尴尬位置：既花了钱，又增加了体积重（因为箱子本身没变小）。所以填充的正确用法是<strong>兜底</strong>——在无法为某组商品找到合适箱型时保证不晃动，而不是常规做法。算法的目标函数应当对填充成本给一个较高的权重，从而优先选到不需要填充的箱。</p>\n<h2 id=\"力学标定与承压\">力学标定与承压</h2><h3 id=\"边压强度与堆码\">边压强度与堆码</h3><p>纸箱的承压能力来自纸板的<strong>边压强度</strong>（ECT，Edge Crush Test，单位 kN/m 或 lb/in），它通过盒压强度（BCT，Box Compression Test，单位 N 或 kgf）与整箱在堆码中的表现关联。行业估算通常使用 McKee 类公式，其简化形式用纸板 ECT、纸板厚度与箱体周长来估 BCT——McKee 1963 年的原始工作同时用到 ECT、纵横向弯曲刚度、箱体周长与箱深，后来的简化版本只保留 ECT、纸板厚度与周长（见 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Box_compression_test\">Box compression test</a>）。需要强调：这类估算对填充后的实际箱体、其他箱型与堆码方向<strong>并不可靠</strong>，最终仍要靠压缩测试验证。</p>\n<h3 id=\"安全系数与堆码层数\">安全系数与堆码层数</h3><p>给定单箱 BCT 后，可堆码层数的估算要考虑仓储时间、湿度与堆码方式带来的折减：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>T</mi><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{stack} = \\frac{BCT \\times f_{env} \\times f_{time}}{W_{box} \\times g \\times S}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2519em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">im</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_{env}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是湿度折减系数（潮湿环境可显著降低纸箱强度）、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_{time}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">im</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是长期载荷折减、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 是安全系数、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{box}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是单箱毛重。这三个系数没有普适值，必须由自家温湿度分布与仓储时长实测得出；把行业传闻值当常数用是常见的翻车点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"目录的数据模型\">目录的数据模型</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE packaging_material (&#10;  material_id     TEXT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  kind            TEXT NOT NULL,        -- box | cushion | void_fill | closure&#10;  fefco_code      TEXT NULL,&#10;  inner_l_mm      INT  NULL,&#10;  inner_w_mm      INT  NULL,&#10;  inner_h_mm      INT  NULL,&#10;  wall_thickness_mm NUMERIC(4,1) NULL,&#10;  board_grade     TEXT NULL,            -- 如 32 ECT / 44 ECT&#10;  max_load_g      INT  NULL,            -- 标称承重上限&#10;  unit_cost_micro BIGINT NOT NULL,      -- 以 1e-6 货币单位存，避免浮点&#10;  currency        TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  min_order_qty   INT  NULL,&#10;  certified_for   TEXT[] NULL,          -- 如 {ISTA_6_AMAZON_SIOC, ISTA_3A}&#10;  active          BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT true,&#10;  CHECK (kind &lt;&gt; &#39;box&#39; OR (inner_l_mm IS NOT NULL AND inner_w_mm IS NOT NULL AND inner_h_mm IS NOT NULL)),&#10;  CHECK (kind &lt;&gt; &#39;box&#39; OR inner_l_mm &gt;= inner_w_mm)&#10;);&#10;CREATE INDEX ON packaging_material (kind, active, inner_l_mm, inner_w_mm, inner_h_mm);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> packaging_material</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  material_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  kind            </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- box | cushion | void_fill | closure</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  fefco_code      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  inner_l_mm      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  inner_w_mm      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  inner_h_mm      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  wall_thickness_mm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  board_grade     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,            </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 如 32 ECT / 44 ECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  max_load_g      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,            </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 标称承重上限</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  unit_cost_micro </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 以 1e-6 货币单位存，避免浮点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  currency        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  min_order_qty   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  certified_for   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 如 {ISTA_6_AMAZON_SIOC, ISTA_3A}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  active          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BOOLEAN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> true,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (kind </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'box'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> OR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (inner_l_mm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inner_w_mm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inner_h_mm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (kind </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'box'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> OR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inner_l_mm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inner_w_mm)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> packaging_material (kind, active, inner_l_mm, inner_w_mm, inner_h_mm);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三种刻意的设计取舍：一是金额以整数微单位存，避免浮点累积误差；二是 <code>CHECK</code> 在数据库层强制箱型必须有内径且长边在前，和尺寸主数据用同一套朝向约定；三是复合索引按长宽高排序，让&quot;找所有能装下这个商品的箱&quot;变成一次范围扫描而不是全表比大小。</p>\n<h3 id=\"箱型档位的设计\">箱型档位的设计</h3><p>包材目录不是越全越好。目录规模与两个代价相关：工位的取箱时间随种类数上升（见 <a href=\"../cost-damage-balance/pack-throughput-dws-automation\">拣包产能与 DWS 自动化</a>），以及每种箱型的采购批量被摊薄导致单价上升。因此目录设计的核心是<strong>档位离散化策略</strong>：沿哪个维度分档、档距取多大。</p>\n<p>工程上常用的做法是让箱型在一个主维度上等间距、跨维度上交错，使得任意体积区间都有两三种可选箱型而不产生大量&quot;只差 1cm&quot;的近重复。判定近重复的实用准则是：如果两个箱型的内径在任一分量上的差距小于商品尺寸分布的噪声水平（即小于选箱容差），它们就是近重复，应当合并。</p>\n<h3 id=\"与商品的匹配度\">与商品的匹配度</h3><p>目录里还应当有第二张表记录<strong>历史匹配</strong>：某箱型装过哪些 SKU、实际破损率如何、平均填充用量多少。这是后面做成本权衡时的先验。没有它，算法只能按几何选箱，无法知道某个箱型在自家链路里其实破损偏高。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>包材库是算法的搜索空间，必须可计算：几何、力学、经济三类属性缺一不可。</li>\n<li>存内径不存外径，外径由壁厚派生；用 FEFCO 编码承载结构语义。</li>\n<li>缓冲与填充是兜底而非主路，目标函数应压高填充成本从而优先选到免填充的箱。</li>\n<li>承压估算靠 McKee 类公式起步，但必须用 ISTA / ASTM D4169 这类运输包装测试验证，验证结论落到目录字段。</li>\n<li>堆码层数公式里的环境、时间折减与安全系数必须实测，不能照搬常数。</li>\n<li>金额用整数微单位，几何不变量用数据库约束，别靠应用层自觉。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸\">延伸</h2><p>易碎与特货的加固规则如何叠加到目录之上，见 <a href=\"packing-spec-fragile-special-reinforce\">包装规范与易碎/特货加固</a>；目录如何被搜索算法遍历，见 <a href=\"../cartonization-algorithm/optimal-carton-selection-algorithm\">单件/多件最优箱选择算法</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"箱/缓冲/填充包材库与选型","id":"箱-缓冲-填充包材库与选型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"箱型与几何标定","id":"箱型与几何标定"},{"level":3,"text":"内径才是可用空间","id":"内径才是可用空间"},{"level":3,"text":"壁厚与内径的换算","id":"壁厚与内径的换算"},{"level":2,"text":"缓冲与填充","id":"缓冲与填充"},{"level":3,"text":"缓冲材料的选型逻辑","id":"缓冲材料的选型逻辑"},{"level":3,"text":"填充与二次利用","id":"填充与二次利用"},{"level":2,"text":"力学标定与承压","id":"力学标定与承压"},{"level":3,"text":"边压强度与堆码","id":"边压强度与堆码"},{"level":3,"text":"安全系数与堆码层数","id":"安全系数与堆码层数"},{"level":2,"text":"目录的数据模型","id":"目录的数据模型"},{"level":3,"text":"箱型档位的设计","id":"箱型档位的设计"},{"level":3,"text":"与商品的匹配度","id":"与商品的匹配度"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸","id":"延伸"}],"prev":{"title":"商品长宽高/重量实测与尺寸主数据","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/packaging-loading-optimization/dimension-packaging-masterdata/item-dimension-weight-masterdata"},"next":{"title":"包装规范与易碎/特货加固（联117/147）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/packaging-loading-optimization/dimension-packaging-masterdata/packing-spec-fragile-special-reinforce"}}